<report>
<title>Kaplan-Meier survival estimates</title>
<block name="group">
<block name="grp">
<p><subtotal><b>@grp</b></subtotal></p>

</block>
<table>
<tr><th>Time</th><th>At risk</th><th>Dead</th><th>Censored</th><th>S</th><th>SE(S)</th><th>H</th><th>SE(H)</th></tr>
<block name="est"><tr><td>@{time:roundu}</td><td>@risk</td><td>@dead</td><td>@cen</td><td>@{s:roundu}</td><td>@{ses:roundu}</td><td>@{h:roundu}</td><td>@{seh:roundu}</td></tr></block>
</table>

<p>Median survival time = @med<br />
<ci>Andersen @{pc:round2}% CI</ci> for median survival time = <ci>@{all:roundu} to @{aul:roundu}</ci><br />
<ci>Brookmeyer-Crowley @{pc:round2}% CI</ci> for median survival time = <ci>@{bll:roundu} to @{bul:roundu}</ci></p>

<p>Mean survival time <ci>(@{pc:round2}% CI)</ci> @lim= @{mu:roundu}  <ci>(@{ll:roundu} to @{ul:roundu})</ci></p>
</block>
</report>
